===Etymology===
According to the ''[[w:Woordenboek der Nederlandsche Taal|Woordenboek der Nederlandsche Taal]]'', the term is an evolution of the now obsolete interjections ''amij'', ''amy'' or ''ammy'' (formed from ''ah'' and the personal pronoun ''[[mij]]''; compare also {{cog|fr|à moi}}), as an exclamation of sorrow or indignation, of sorrow, pain, aversion, pity, etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nl|/aːˈmɑi̯/}}
* {{audio|nl|Nl-amai.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyphenation|nl|amai}}

